// Israel 2012 theater: 2012 Fictional War
// Built from the 2007 scenario with the aircraft of 2012 (Sufa in numbers, Egypt's F-16 fleet, MiG-29SM Syria, no Rafale)
// A fundamentalist Arab alliance strikes an Israel the US does not support: Egypt and Syria attack at once, Saudi Arabia
// joins on day 2, the US stays out; Jordan and Iraq stay out too.

#TOTAL_EVENTS 22
#SET_EVENT 3
#ENDINIT

//EVENT#1 Syria joins Egypt (Syria is merged into team 6)
#IF_EVENT_PLAYED 1
#ELSE
#CHANGE_RELATIONS 5 6 1
#DO_EVENT 1
#ENDIF

// Israel on the offensive
#IF_EVENT_PLAYED 3
#IF_ON_OFFENSIVE 2
#PLAY_MOVIE 105
#DO_EVENT 2
#RESET_EVENT 3
#ENDIF
#ENDIF

// Israel on the defensive
#IF_EVENT_PLAYED 2
#IF_ON_OFFENSIVE 6
#SHIFT_INITIATIVE 2 6 50
#PLAY_MOVIE 109
#DO_EVENT 3
#RESET_EVENT 2
#ENDIF
#ENDIF

//EVENT#8 Saudi Arabia joins the Arab alliance (day 2); the US never joins
#IF_EVENT_PLAYED 8
#ELSE
#IF_CAMPAIGN_DAY G 2
#CHANGE_RELATIONS 7 6 1
#DO_EVENT 8
#ENDIF
#ENDIF

// Israel wins: it holds Damascus (city, intersection, airport) or Suez and Ismailia
#IF_CONTROLLED 2 A 1471 1472 29
#PLAY_MOVIE 101
#DO_EVENT 6
#END_GAME 6
#ENDIF
#IF_CONTROLLED 2 A 1008 1137
#PLAY_MOVIE 101
#DO_EVENT 6
#END_GAME 6
#ENDIF

// The Arab alliance (Syria is team 6 now) wins if it holds Haifa: Bat Galim, Carmel, Hadar, Haifa Naval Base
#IF_CONTROLLED 6 A 350 284 288 25
#DO_EVENT 7
#END_GAME 7
#ENDIF
// ... or Tel Aviv: Tel Aviv, Kiryat Ono, Ben Gurion Airbase
#IF_CONTROLLED 6 A 183 208 27
#DO_EVENT 7
#END_GAME 7
#ENDIF

// Time limit: the Arab alliance has nine days to take Haifa or Tel Aviv; if it has not, Israel has held
#IF_EVENT_PLAYED 7
#ELSE
#IF_EVENT_PLAYED 6
#ELSE
#IF_CAMPAIGN_DAY G 9
#DO_EVENT 5
#END_GAME 6
#ENDIF
#ENDIF
#ENDIF

#ENDSCRIPT
